{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "cd8af429-ae54-8612-bc2a-30aa98bb207c",
  "created_at": "2025-12-18T12:03:32-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Peter Tillinghast",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:02:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:02:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, I'm calling about a streetlight? It's like, flickering on and off. It did it all night, through the whole rain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:02:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, all night flickering. Can you tell me where the light is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:02:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's at 212 Malbone Road, in the North End. The pole's right out front by the curb, totally visible from the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:02:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "212 Malbone Road. And it's the pole at the curb in front of the house, is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:02:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's the one. Could you send a crew to check the pole? Like, make sure it's not a wiring thing with all the wet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:02:55-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in a request for a crew to look at it. With the rain wrapping up today they may be busy, but it'll be logged. Is there a number on the pole, a little tag or sticker?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:03:07-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I'd have to go look. I can't see it from here. I walk around town photographing old doorways, so I'm out there a lot, I can check on my way out? But the address should do it, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:03:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The address is fine. If you do see a number, call back and we'll add it. Can I confirm your number as 401-555-0195?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:03:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's it. Thanks so much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T12:03:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Tillinghast. Take care."
    }
  ],
